        {
          "text": "mutaswiilili majwi aamusinsimi oyo na siziloto oyo pe, nkaambo Jehova Leza wanu ulamusunka, kuti azibe na mulayandisya Jehova Leza wanu camoyo woonse acamuuya woonse. ",
