        },
        {
          "text": "Pele oyo musinsimi na siziloto uleelede kujayigwa, nkaambo waamba majwi aakumuleesya kuli-Jehova Leza wanu iwakamupozya munyika ya-Egepita akumuvuna muŋanda yabuzike; wasoleka kumugwisya munzila Jehova Leza wanu njaakamulailila kuti mweende mulinjiyo. Aboobo mulamanisya bubi akati kanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
