        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakoongelezya munyoko, mwana wabanyoko, naba mwanaako mulombe na musimbi, naba mukaako uuli muntaamo yako, naba mweenzinyoko ngoyandisya mbuli mboliyanda omwini, cakwaamba kuti, Atweende tukakombe baleza bambi, nkokuti baleza mbotezi, yebo nebaba bamauso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
